<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.825 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.825 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS200 million   5.825	 5.82-5.83   5.865 (Dec 18)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$200 million, pct allotted at top 50)</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS200 million   5.895	 5.89-5.90   5.900 (Dec 18)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$200 million, pct allotted at top 20)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS400 million   5.807	 5.79-5.83   5.854 (Dec 18)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$400 million, pct allotted at top 20)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
